    {
      "id": "r20261101-a01",
      "title": "The Kind Bus Driver",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Every morning, Tono takes the number 12 bus to school. The driver, Mr. Hasan, always smiles and says good morning to every passenger.",
        "One rainy Tuesday, Tono left his umbrella on the bus. He was very sad because it was a gift from his father. The next day, Mr. Hasan saw Tono and called him. \"Is this yours?\" he asked, holding the umbrella.",
        "Tono was so happy. He thanked Mr. Hasan and gave him a drawing of the blue bus. Now the drawing hangs next to the driver's seat, and they are good friends."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "driver": "sopir",
        "passenger": "penumpang",
        "umbrella": "payung",
        "gift": "hadiah",
        "holding": "memegang",
        "hangs": "tergantung"
      },
